d. remove or alter copyright, attribution, or license notices;
e. represent the Software or derivative works as independently licensed open-source software; or
f. use the Software to provide a hosted service or shared computing service to third parties.

5. Expiration

When the five-day evaluation period expires, all rights granted under this license end
automatically unless the Licensor provides a new authorization or a separate written
license.

The recipient must stop executing and using the Software after expiration. Local copies
may be retained only for archival or source-review purposes if they are not executed,
